# hold.script - one key held 3 s (left, in the bottom tunnel at the start of level 1). On
# the board before the 2026-11 firmware the key went up by itself after 1 s; run with
# run816.py --kbd-release 1000 to see that (the digger stops after a third of the way).
2500 key enter 100
7000 key left 3000
10500 shot
11000 key esc 100
12500 key esc 100
